---
import League from '../layouts/League.astro';
---
<League title="Register" description="How to register for spring soccer, fees and financial help.">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <h1>Register for spring</h1>
    <p>Spring registration opens January 5 and closes February 15. This is a concept site, so there is no real sign-up form.</p>
    <h2>Who can play</h2>
    <p>Children ages 5 to 12 by August 1 of the season year. Divisions are Under 8, Under 10 and Under 12.</p>
    <h2>Cost</h2>
    <p>The fee is $60 per player and includes a jersey and socks. Families with more than one player pay for the first two only.</p>
    <h2>Financial help</h2>
    <p>No child is turned away because of cost. Ask the registrar, and you will not be asked why.</p>
    <h2>What you need</h2>
    <ul><li>Your child's name and birth date.</li><li>A parent or guardian's phone and email.</li><li>Any health or access needs we should know about.</li></ul>
    <h2>Volunteer</h2>
    <p>We always need coaches, referees and snack-stand help. No experience is needed, and we will train you.</p>
  </div>
</League>
